WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
The heating season has started in Belgrade.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:19.500
Belgrade Power Plants have officially started the heating season with unchanged heat prices, but 60 out of 100 apartments are moving to billing by actual consumption instead of by square metres, which lets citizens pay smaller bills if they save energy.

3
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:31.500
To save energy, the system automatically switches off the heating when the outside temperature goes above 15 degrees, while at zero and lower temperatures the radiators heat continuously for 24 hours.
